      "type": "text",
      "text": "Strict Leave-One-Dataset-Out  \u2022  230 subjects  \u2022  K = 5\n\nGCN single:    94.47% accuracy   \u2022   0.9845 AUC   \u2022   217 / 230 subjects correct\nEnsemble:       98.22% accuracy   \u2022   0.9961 AUC   \u2022   226 / 230 subjects correct\n\nBeats prior cross-site SOTA:  TransformEEG 80.10%  \u2022  ARP-N 80.6%  \u2022  MCPNet 90.2% (2 datasets only)",
      "originalText": "Strict Leave-One-Dataset-Out  \u2022  230 subjects  \u2022  K = 5\n\nGCN single:    94.47% accuracy   \u2022   0.9845 AUC   \u2022   217 / 230 subjects correct\nEnsemble:       98.22% accuracy   \u2022   0.9961 AUC   \u2022   226 / 230 subjects correct\n\nBeats prior cross-site SOTA:  TransformEEG 80.10%  \u2022  ARP-N 80.6%  \u2022  MCPNet 90.2% (2 datasets only)",
